WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — jouleos (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:11.428
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, awọn kọmputa ti ọjọ iwaju ṣe ikojọpọ ọpọlọpọ awọn ipele oriṣiriṣi, ati pe awọn aṣoju AI ni a fi sori ẹrọ lori oke laisi iyipada.

2
00:00:11.508 --> 00:00:17.864
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ọrọ miiran, ko si ohun ti o le ṣe lati pinnu iye agbara ti a yoo lo.

3
00:00:17.944 --> 00:00:30.490
<v Narrator>Oju-iwe ayelujara kan le jẹ ohun elo ti o ṣe iranlọwọ fun awọn olumulo lati ṣakoso awọn iṣẹ wọn, ṣetọju awọn iroyin wọn ati ṣe ibaraẹnisọrọ pẹlu ara wọn.
